   What you are using is actually an Alpha version of the brand new
   TransAmiga v1.1.  Because it is alpha, changes are being made
   constantly, and often bugs will appear.  For this reason you may
   experience certain 'irregularities' while on here.  If you do
   just leave me a message saying what happened, I will work on
   fixing it.                                                        
                                                              
   This version is several months away from release, so don't be
   turned off if you do find some bugs.  The latest public release
   TransAmiga is v1.06 (available in the file section), and that is
   certainly much more stable.                                
                                                              
   If you have any suggestions for things you'd like to see added to
   this version please let me know (although chances are you'd be
   able to add them yourself through its flexible ARexx interface),
   I quite open to new ideas.                                   
                                                              
   Thank you for your patience and enjoy the board!           
                                                              
                                                              
   -Tim                                                       
